@startuml
title 分析状态机图（七）— 公众号排版任务
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F5FAFF
skinparam classBorderColor #46637F
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 45
hide empty description
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F5FAFF
skinparam stateBorderColor #46637F

state "待接单" as Unassigned
state "待排版" as Working
state "待一审" as First
state "待二审" as Second
state "待修改" as Returned
state "已归档" as Archived
[*] --> Unassigned
Unassigned --> Working : 接单派发()\n[运营部长指定干事与两岗人员]\n/ 建立承接和审核岗位
Working --> First : 提交排版成果()\n[当前干事且成果完整]\n/ 保存成果与附件
First --> Returned : 审核归档()\n[一审退回且意见完整]\n/ 记录意见
Returned --> First : 提交排版成果()\n[修订完整]\n/ 保存新成果
First --> Second : 审核归档()\n[一审通过且两岗不同]\n/ 进入二审
First --> Archived : 审核归档()\n[一审通过且两岗相同]\n/ 归档并结算规则工时
Second --> Returned : 审核归档()\n[二审退回且意见完整]\n/ 记录意见
Second --> Archived : 审核归档()\n[二审通过]\n/ 归档并结算规则工时
Archived : 审核归档()\n[重复合法请求]\n/ 返回原结果，不重复结算
note bottom of Archived
  审核事件记录真实操作人；未发生的二审不伪造记录。
  排版审核总工时按规则分摊，报名加急只触发提醒。
end note

@enduml
